{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,15]],"date-time":"2026-10-15T16:34:08Z","timestamp":1792082048504,"version":"4.4.0"},"reference-count":55,"publisher":"World Scientific Pub Co Pte Ltd","issue":"07","funder":[{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["61872406"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["61872406"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/501100001809","name":"National Natural Science Foundation of China","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["61472094"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["61472094"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/501100001809","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"name":"Guangxi Key Technologies R&D Program","award":["AB23026034"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["AB23026034"]}]}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["Int. J. Quantum Inform."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2024,10]]},"abstract":"<jats:p> A relay-assisted scheme for quantum key distribution (QKD) over long atmospheric channels is proposed. In this scheme, a polarization orbital-angular-moment with measurement-device-independent (POAM-MDI) QKD for quantum relay is designed to both reconstruct the turbulence-degraded qubits and redirect the qubits to the next relay or to Bob who performs detection randomization. The proposed scheme will neither be time-consuming nor lead to unstable or even intermittent in volatile environments. Theoretical and numerical results show that the proposed relay-assisted scheme outperforms the conventional direct transmission over long atmospheric channels. <\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1142\/s0219749924500175","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2024,3,9]],"date-time":"2024-03-09T15:24:06Z","timestamp":1709997846000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":2,"title":["Quant